.bridgie/specs/statement-review/design.md:79:                    --> pack written once: memo.md, record.html, evidence.json, monthly.csv
.bridgie/specs/statement-review/design.md:234:      packs/<snapshot>/  written once at sign-off: memo.md, record.html, evidence.json, monthly.csv
.bridgie/specs/statement-review/design.md:262:**Pack.** memo.md has the sections in field-map order, figures with their ids, and blanks left for the underwriter. While the check is shown, it then has a 'Policy check (illustrative)' section that no memo field maps to. Its first line is the label, followed by the overall outcome and each rule, with the metric value tagged [Mn] and the threshold tagged [Rn] after a limit word. record.html is self-contained and makes no external requests; it shows the label wherever an outcome appears, and shows the sign-off. The pack also holds evidence.json (v1) and monthly.csv. It is written once, at sign-off, to a new folder named by the snapshot hash.
.bridgie/specs/statement-review/design.md:315:- The committed examples (examples/cafe_stretched.memo.md, .memo.evidence.json and .truth.json) are regenerated in the same change. The CSV is byte-identical; the appendix gains M17-M28, M16's new name and M2's reworded method; in the truth file, the director capital line becomes director_funding. test_categoriser_matches_truth runs under v2; v1 is covered by P7, which compares values.
